        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: недавно",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "недавно (nedávno) — \"recently\". Russian's past usually ends in -л, with -ла for a woman: Недавно я читал книгу. — nedávno ya chitál knígu — \"Recently I read a book.\" A woman says читала."
            }
          ]
        },
